# The olive-growing town west of Mesagoza: its groves, its square and Katy's bakery, an oboe's tune in G over a nylon
# guitar's strum, an accordion on the off-beats, castanets and a soft kit, warm as fresh bread; at night a clarinet and
# a harp. Original composition for this game (plan 34 · PD3's second session), in the modern sound.
